### Paste a fresh token printed by: python3 scripts/get_token.py
@token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN
@orderId = REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID

### POST: create draft; copy the returned id into orderId
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-create

{"sku":"BOOK-1","quantity":1,"note":"Pratik learning HTTP"}

### GET: one resource
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET: filter, sort, paginate
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders?status=DRAFT&page=0&size=10&sort=amount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PUT: replace all editable fields, before checkout
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"BOOK-1","quantity":2,"note":"Replaced draft"}

### PATCH: change one editable field, before checkout
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note":"Updated note"}

### POST action: checkout; use the SAME id when retrying
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: manual-checkout

### v2: same record, different public response shape
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v2/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Payment result
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/by-order/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inventory event-driven sales ledger
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/inventory/BOOK-1/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Compare clients: restclient | webclient | feign | resttemplate
GET http://localhost:8081/api/lab/clients/feign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: client-comparison

### Token forwarding
GET http://localhost:8081/api/lab/forward-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Fail the next two Payment calls; third attempt succeeds
POST http://localhost:8082/api/lab/faults
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"503","remaining":2,"delayMs":0}

### Fault status and received payment-call count
GET http://localhost:8082/api/lab/faults
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reset faults
POST http://localhost:8082/api/lab/faults
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"none","remaining":0,"delayMs":0}

### Circuit state
GET http://localhost:8081/api/lab/circuit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reset circuit
POST http://localhost:8081/api/lab/circuit/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Outbox rows, newest first
GET http://localhost:8082/api/lab/outbox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inbound request measurements
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/metrics/http.server.requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DELETE: succeeds only for a DRAFT order; paid/pending yields 409
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
